{
    "description": "OpenEmbedded ROS - Wrynose Lyrical (AMD/Xilinx Kria + Versal). A separate config from oeros-wrynose-lyrical because meta-xilinx-multimedia sets PREFERRED_VERSION_gstreamer1.0* to AMD's 1.28.2+amd fork from its layer.conf, and bitbake-setup bb-layers are shared across every machine option in one config file -- adding it there would swap GStreamer for every other vendor's board too. AMD layers are pinned to the rel-v2026.2 release (LAYERSERIES_COMPAT wrynose). See docs/amd-xilinx.md.",
    "sources": {
        "bitbake": {
            "git-remote": {
                "uri": "https://git.openembedded.org/bitbake",
                "branch": "2.18",
                "rev": "2.18"
            }
        },
        "openembedded-core": {
